# Eval and experiment run outputs. Reports that back a README claim are
# checked in deliberately, one at a time -- not swept in by a glob.
evals/runs/
experiments/runs/

# Design canvas build output (~2 MB, regenerated by the design skill's seeder from
# the .dc.html sources, which ARE checked in).
design/trace-inspector.html
design/_*.py
design/_*.html

# Local agent instructions. Maintained project documentation in docs/ is published.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

